{"id":"msg_m_ex_oldtales_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_oldtales","label":"Old Tales · Group"},"label":"2. I can't believe it!","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_oldtales_01","next":null,"speakers":{"grave":"Grave","cinderella":"Cinderella"},"icons":{"grave":"si_c514_00_s","cinderella":"si_c511_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_1","text":"I can't believe it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_2","text":"I just received the most amazing gift.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_3","text":"Cinderella's hair.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_4","text":"It's always been silky smooth,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_5","text":"but now it flows even more than before.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_6","text":"It has a breathtaking fragrance to it as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_7","text":"I feel as if its beauty has deepened even further.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_8","text":"I'm glad you approve, hehe. I borrowed some essential oils from Anis.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_9","text":"Oh.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_10","text":"That was a lovely gesture.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_11","text":"Your hair-brushing skills have also improved.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_12","text":"I'm sure we have Grave's impeccable instruction to thank for that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_13","text":"Oh no, it wasn't just me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_14","text":"Superhuman is incredibly intelligent.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_15","text":"If you teach him one thing, he learns ten.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_16","text":"He picks things up quickly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_17","text":"Only because you explained things so well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_18","text":"Seeing you two compliment each other like this...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_19","text":"It's so beautiful.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_20","text":"Erm... you're making me feel embarrassed, talking like that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_21","text":"There's still plenty of essential oil left, so why don't you try some, Grave?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_22","text":"Oh my.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_23","text":"What an absolutely wonderful idea!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_24","text":"You've always been the one brushing my hair,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_25","text":"Grave,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_26","text":"so today I'll brush yours.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_27","text":"While I'm at it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_28","text":"how would you like me to tie up your hair into twintails like mine? I think it would look lovely on you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_29","text":"Thank you, but that's all right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_30","text":"It doesn't matter how much of the essential oil is left, it should be left for Cinderella.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_31","text":"I don't need it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_32","text":"No, I want to brush your hair myself,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_33","text":"and apply some of this essential oil.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_34","text":"Honestly, I'm okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_35","text":"If you're going to insist on turning me down,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_36","text":"you ought to give me a good reason.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_37","text":"Otherwise, that's the most un-beautiful behavior.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_38","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_39","text":"Uh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_40","text":"I'm embarrassed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_41","text":"It's awkward.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_42","text":"You two keep complimenting me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_43","text":"and Cinderella is offering to style my hair herself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_44","text":"It just feels awkward.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_45","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_46","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_47","text":"Then we'll have to do it until you get used to it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_48","text":"An excellent suggestion, Prince.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_49","text":"You and I are on the same page.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_50","text":"Are you free right now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_51","text":"I sure am.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_52","text":"In that case, come over straight away.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_53","text":"Will do.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_54","text":"Wait a second.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_55","text":"This is going to be a wonderful time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_56","text":"I'm so excited!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_57","text":"As long as you're happy,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_58","text":"I'm happy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_oldtales_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_oldtales_02_59","text":"I'll wait for you, Superhuman.","jump":null}],"chat":true}